#framework based on: 
#CF = delta*M*tau where M = Q/S/alpha. For the most basic recipe, we need cloud sinks and source,in_cloud cloud mass, in cloud mass flux, 
#cloud fraction, static stability, clear sky radiative cooling. We will also contrast with Beydoun et al for which we need CSC
